<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NAB files for A$862.5 mln issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NAB files for A$862.5 mln issue.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Ltd and its wholly-owned subsidiaries National Australia Capital Securities (UK) Plc and National Australia Capital Securities (Jersey) Ltd said they have filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to raise up to US$862.5 million.</p>
<p>The issue comprises US$750 million as previously announced on November 29 and an over-allotment option of US$112.5 million.</p>
</text>
